WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:15.120
Kip was laughing.

2
00:00:15.121 --> 00:00:17.889
He was very loud.

3
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:28.742
Bird could not sleep.

4
00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:34.534
"Please be quiet, Kip," said Bird.

5
00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:37.928
"Sorry!" said Kip.

6
00:00:37.929 --> 00:00:44.941
Kip read some more.

7
00:00:44.942 --> 00:00:48.743
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

8
00:00:48.744 --> 00:00:52.310
Bird tossed and turned.

9
00:00:52.311 --> 00:00:55.812
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

10
00:00:55.813 --> 00:00:59.332
Bird covered her ears.

11
00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:06.675
"Ugh," she said. "I can't sleep.

12
00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:09.260
Kip is keeping me awake!"

13
00:01:09.261 --> 00:01:12.952
Bird flew up to Kip's hole.

14
00:01:12.953 --> 00:01:15.896
"Kip," said Bird.

15
00:01:15.897 --> 00:01:19.676
"I'm trying to—"

16
00:01:19.677 --> 00:01:26.227
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

17
00:01:26.228 --> 00:01:29.258
"Hey, Bird," said Kip.

18
00:01:29.259 --> 00:01:32.042
"This book is so funny!

19
00:01:32.043 --> 00:01:34.550
Here, read this part."

20
00:01:34.551 --> 00:01:39.131
Kip gave the book to Bird.

21
00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:42.943
Bird read.

22
00:01:42.944 --> 00:01:53.726
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed. "That is funny!"

23
00:01:53.727 --> 00:02:01.324
Bird sat down.

24
00:02:01.325 --> 00:02:06.658
She ate some popcorn.

25
00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:09.600
Bird read some more.

26
00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:13.850
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

27
00:02:13.851 --> 00:02:17.660
"Where did you get this book?" she asked.

28
00:02:17.661 --> 00:02:20.392
Kip didn't answer.

29
00:02:20.393 --> 00:02:26.963
"Kip?" said Bird.

30
00:02:26.964 --> 00:02:30.258
Bird looked at Kip.

31
00:02:30.259 --> 00:02:38.989
He was asleep in his bed.
